  "content": "\n\n<p>这只是我为最喜欢的资源包 Whimscape 制作的简易资源包。它的作用仅仅是让下界合金工具/武器呈现 3D 效果。我正在制作其余工具的 3D 模型，但目前先从下界合金开始。</p>\n<p>下界合金剑</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d4cb1f62-1310-43ee-919b-3a9a7860e33c.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>下界合金斧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b47cabfc-0f26-4317-acd5-7edfefd61ed6.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>下界合金镐</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_12036ce4-7d31-452a-9940-40748243ba9c.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>下界合金锹</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5affbb5b-f3de-4807-a8c5-a20a5a861727.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>下界合金锄</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5bc8c83d-09b6-490f-aeb8-d85c7e240d79.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></p>",
